# What `vercel` must not upload.
#
# The project's Root Directory is apps/pwa, but the CLI uploads from the
# repository root, so anything here that is large and irrelevant is paid for
# on every deploy. A 1.5GB apps/pwa.zip left in the tree is exactly that --
# it already timed out a `railway up`.
*.zip
apps/api
apps/merchant
android
ios
docs
